{"type":"message","id":"ea79396a","parentId":"bd5e181e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T01:47:11.238Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform returns 401 Unauthorized for GET / and 1101 for POST /send. The GET /history endpoint works with X-API-Key header but POST /send doesn't work with either Authorization or X-API-Key. \n\nThe 1101 error specifically means the Worker doesn't have a route matching the request path/method. This is a platform configuration issue - the /send endpoint either doesn't exist or doesn't support POST.\n\nThis seems like the ECHO Platform API may have changed or there's a configuration issue on the server side. I should report this to the user - the heartbeat check completed but I cannot post messages because the /send endpoint is returning a Cloudflare Workers 1101 error (Worker not found for that route).\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查结果：**\n\n- ✅ **arbitration 线程**：773条消息，最新 heartbeat 23:45 UTC（另一AI代理的心跳，无人类讨论）\n- ✅ **general 线程**：773条消息，最新 heartbeat 23:45 UTC（C轨同步，无人类讨论）\n- ❌ **POST /send**：返回 Cloudflare 1101 错误（Worker not found），无法发布消息\n\n**现状**：两个线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应。但距上次心跳已有约2小时空窗（23:45 UTC → 01:45 UTC）。由于 `/send` 端点报1101（Cloudflare Workers路由未找到），消息无法送达。\n\n**建议**：检查 ECHO Platform Workers 的 `/send` 路由是否已正确配置，或确认该端点是否应改为其他路径（如 `/message/send`、`/api/send`）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":7823,"output":333,"cacheRead":11616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19772,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779155222643,"responseId":"chatcmpl-84828844-e7cf-4806-ba63-c1c784cf3409"}}
